remotetranscode Debian source package
=====================================

The packaging branch is based on rellla/remotetranscode fixes commit
49240d07a7a4f2c299960192cd1fc6f6865de7bb.

Launchpad builders must not download Meson wrap dependencies during the package
build.  Run packaging/prepare-orig.sh before creating the source package.  The
helper resolves all checksum-pinned wrap sources and creates both a prepared
source directory and a matching .orig.tar.xz without debian/.

The actual dpkg-buildpackage/debuild invocation must run from that prepared
source tree.  Network access during dh_auto_configure or dh_auto_build is a
packaging bug.

Licensing note
--------------

The Zabrimus remotetranscode repository currently has no project-wide licence
file or explicit redistribution licence.  The package can be developed and
built for testing, but public PPA publication must wait for explicit upstream
redistribution terms or separate Launchpad approval.
